{%- comment -%}
  snippets/kj-nav.liquid

  Brand and fabric links resolve through kj-collection-url rather than
  being built by string concatenation. The mega menu names about sixty
  collections and most of them did not exist yet, so most of the menu
  was links to a Shopify 404 — the same fault the brand strip and the
  brand directory had. Each one now falls back to its gender collection
  and starts pointing at the real thing the moment it is created.
  Brand lists come from the client's approved inventory whitelist
  (Inventory brand names.pdf, 6 Sep 2026). Nothing outside that list appears.
  LADA sits first and in brass — it is the flagship, not a peer department.
{%- endcomment -%}
